    <string name="rules_mine">My rules</string>
    <string name="rules_mine_note">One rule per line, matched top to bottom before the routing mode\'s and the subscription\'s rules. The policy is PROXY (the current node or the subscription\'s first policy group), DIRECT or REJECT. Supports DOMAIN, DOMAIN-SUFFIX, DOMAIN-KEYWORD, DOMAIN-WILDCARD, IP-CIDR, IP-CIDR6, DST-PORT, PROCESS-NAME, USER-AGENT, URL-REGEX and PROTOCOL; lines starting with # are comments.</string>
